      "body": "My fix for this issue is more minimal compared to what was done in gh-30577 (and accidentally reverted in gh-94673).  The original fix untracks all GC objects and increfs them.  I think that's more than required.  We just need to make sure none of them refer to the GC head nodes that we are going to free.  At least, I think that's enough and it fixes the weechat crash.  Need to check the Kodi crash too.",
